700	     * telephone, the lower-cased email (or empty when absent) and the {@link Soundex Soundex}
701	     * code of the last name, joined by {@code '|'}. Two owners collide on this key only when
702	     * they share a telephone, an email and a phonetically-equal surname, so it is the single
703	     * fingerprint the create endpoint's duplicate check keys off. Derived from stored state,
704	     * never persisted.
