344	    /**
345	     * Whether this owner resembles an existing one: {@code true} when, at creation, it shared
346	     * an existing owner's postcode and a phonetically-equal last name ({@link Soundex Soundex})
347	     * yet differed in {@link #getIdentityKey() identity key} and was not a declared household
348	     * member, {@code false} otherwise. A declared member (created with {@code sharesHousehold})
349	     * is a genuine member, not a suspected duplicate. When true, {@link #getPossibleDuplicateOf()}
350	     * holds that owner's id. Captured at creation.
