374	     * Whether this owner has been soft-deleted: {@code true} once a {@code DELETE} has
375	     * flagged the record (which is retained rather than removed), {@code false} for a live
376	     * owner. A newly created owner is not deleted. A deleted owner is still returned by
377	     * {@code GET}, but is ignored by the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks.
378	     */
